    "sections": {
        "description": "BizLink is a premium Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed for businesses, consulting agencies, law firms, and educational institutions that need a modern, flexible, and high-performing online presence. It offers complete design control over every website element, allowing effortless customization without code, while maintaining a clean and professional aesthetic. Built with seamless integration for WooCommerce, WPML, and Contact Form 7, BizLink supports eCommerce functionality, multilingual websites, and efficient client communication out of the box. Optimized for speed and SEO, and equipped with ready-to-use templates, it helps you launch polished, conversion-focused websites quickly and scale them with ease as your business grows. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/bizlink/"
    },
